{"id": "189158", "name": "השלמה לבסיס אורתוגונלי", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "innerproduct", "params": ["x", "y"], "body": "block([listarith],listarith:true,ratsimp(conjugate(x).y))"}, {"name": "gramschmidt_mat_cols", "params": ["x"], "body": "transpose(apply(matrix,gramschmidt(transpose(x))))"}, {"name": "gen_rand_3_mat", "params": ["n"], "body": "matrix([1,rand_with_prohib(-n,n,[0]),rand_with_prohib(-n,n,[])],[0,1,rand_with_prohib(-n,n,[])],[0,0,1]) . transpose(matrix([1,rand_with_prohib(-n,n,[]),rand_with_prohib(-n,n,[0])],[0,1,rand_with_prohib(-n,n,[])],[0,0,1]))"}, {"name": "get_rand_orth_basis", "params": ["n"], "body": "gramschmidt_mat_cols(gen_rand_3_mat(n))"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתבונן במרחב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{R}^3\\)</span> עם המכפלה הפנימית הסטנדרטית.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>מצאו בסיס אורתוגונלי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(B\\)</span> המקיים כי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u\\in B\\)</span>, עבור הוקטור</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ u = {{CT:0}} \\]</p><p>כתבו רק את הוקטורים הנוספים בבסיס (שאינם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u\\)</span>). נסמן</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[B\\setminus \\{u\\} =\\{v_1,v_2\\} \\]</p><p>מצאו <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v_1,v_2\\)</span>:</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(v_1=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p class=\"input-hint input-hint-grid\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:right\">איך מזינים: כל איבר בתיבה משלו: מספר, שבר (למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">1/2</code>) או ביטוי (למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">sqrt(2)</code>).</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(v_2=\\) [[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\">הדרך להזנת כפל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:1}}\\)</span> היא <code dir=\"ltr\">a*b</code>. הדרך להזנת חילוק <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:2}}\\)</span> היא <code dir=\"ltr\">a/b</code>.</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "", "prtpartiallycorrect": "", "prtincorrect": "", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "matrix", "boxsize": 25, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "matrix", "boxsize": 25, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 1, "nodes": [{"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "rank(addcol(ans1,ans2))", "tans": "2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">הוקטורים שהזנתם תלויים לינארית.</div>"}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "(transpose(addcol(col(base_mat,1),ans1,ans2)) . addcol(col(base_